DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer$1 Drink Fridays: “Battle of
  the Decades” DJ Party (North Beach)Fridays are now a little bit more aw
 esome. Did someone say $1 drinks?\nMonroe in North Beach hosts “Battle o
 f the Decades” DJ party and happy hour every Friday with a DJ spinning p
