DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe 20th Annual Huntington’s
  Disease Society of America San Francisco Team Hope 5K Timed Run & 5K Walk
  will be on October 3\, 2026 at Presidio Sports Basement at Crissy Field i
 n SF\; 610 Old Mason Street. Come and celebrate and enjoy the cake that wi
 ll be served.\n\nHuntington’s disease is a rare\, genetic\, fatal brain 
 disorder that is in the neurodegenerative category like Alzheimer’s\, Pa
 rkinson’s and ALS.\nRegistration is FREE and starts at 9 a.m. and run/wa
 lk on Crissy Field begins at 10 am. After the participants return\, there 
 will be a short program to thank our sponsors and companies that donated i
 tem to our silent auction and raffle. Top 3 runners will be awarded a meda
 l. The event will have silent auction and raffle items to help boost reven
 ue to help in the fight against Huntington’s Disease and to provides edu
 cation\, support groups\, social workers and funds for research & clinical
  trials for Huntington’s disease families in the San Francisco Bay Area.
 \n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://give.hdsa.org/event/2026-team-hope-walk-run-s
 an-francisco/e723928\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/20th-anniversary-hd
