DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerThe 30th Annual Middle Eastern
  Food Festival at St. Nicholas Antiochian Orthodox Church in San Francisco
  offers a day of authentic Middle Eastern cuisine\, live music\, cultural 
