 kah lounge. The event is family-friendly and free to attend\, highlighting
  both food and cultural traditions. Parking is available at 350 Amber Dr.\
 nOriginal Event Description:\n_30th Annual Middle Eastern Food Festival 
 – Saturday\nVenue: St. Nicholas Antiochian Orthodox Church\nAddress: 520
 0 Diamond Heights Boulevard\, San Francisco\, CA 94131\nStart: 2026-10-03T
 12:00:00\nEnd: 2026-10-03T21:00:00\nCost: Free\nOrganizer: St. Nicholas Ch
 urch\nGet ready for a delicious celebration of Middle Eastern food\, cultu
 re\, and community!Join us as we celebrate 30 years of food\, faith\, cult
 ure\, and community!Enjoy an incredible variety of authentic favorites\, i
 ncluding savory kebabs\, falafel\, shawarma\, hummus\, tabbouleh\, kibbeh\
 , stuffed grape leaves\, and so much more. And don’t forget to stop by o
 ur sweets table for an irresistible selection of handmade Middle Eastern d
 esserts!Experience the rich culture and traditions of the Middle East with
  live music\, entertainment\, and performances throughout the festival. Br
 owse our local vendor booths featuring unique crafts\, jewelry\, gifts\, a
 nd more.There’s something for everyone to enjoy. Families can visit our 
 Kids Corner for ages 3–12\, featuring arts & crafts\, activities\, and e
 ntertain...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/30th-annual-m
 iddle-eastern-food-festival-saturday-tickets-1999193916822\nDetails: https
