SUMMARY:Red Bull Batalla “Bay Under Cup” Freestyle Spanish Rap Battle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1635435@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerRed Bull Batalla “Bay Under 
 Cup” Freestyle Rap Battle | SF\nGet ready to witness the raw energy of t
 he Bay Area’s premier Spanish-language freestyle rap tournament! The Bay
  Under Cup is officially here\, serving as a high-stakes qualifier for the
  Red Bull Batalla USA National Finals 26/27.\nSponsored by Red Bull Batall
 a\, this event brings together the fiercest MCs to go head-to-head on stag
 e\, delivering hard-hitting punchlines and off-the-dome lyricism to secure
  their spot in the national spotlight. Whether you are a die-hard fan of r
 ap hispano or just love the unmatched hype of a live MC clash\, this is an
  afternoon of pure hip-hop culture you won’t want to miss.\n\nEvent Deta
 ils\n\nDate: Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\n\nTime: 3:00 PM\n\nVenue: Kimbar
 a\n\nLocation: 3380 19th St\, San Francisco\, CA\n\nAge Restriction: All A
 ges (Valid government-issued ID required to drink at the bar)\n\nThe Lineu
 p\n\nHost: Noelia FCH will be steering the ship and keeping the crowd hype
 d.\n\nOn the Decks: DJ Casanova supplying the heavy beats for the MCs.\n\n
 Judges: Chester\, Moha\, and Tito Yang make up the expert panel deciding w
 ho advances.\n\nPartners: Brought to you in collaboration with Liricista R
 ap Hispano and Kimbara.\n\n(Note: This event authentically celebrates Hisp
 anic hip-hop culture\, and the rap battles will be conducted entirely in S
 PANISH.)\n🇪🇸\nBatalla de Freestyle “Bay Under Cup” de Red Bull B
 atalla | SF\n¡Prepárate para presenciar la energía pura del principal t
 orneo de rap freest...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dc_
 nwU3sAGF/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/red-bull-batalla-bay-cup-frees
