SUMMARY:Sunday Reset: Guided Meditation & Energy Blessing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T160000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637573@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Community
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer\n\nA 2-hour Sunday reset with
  guided meditation and Energy Blessing. Relax\, recharge\, and reconnect. 
 No meditation experience needed.\n\nGive yourself two hours this Sunday to
  slow down\, settle in\, and recharge.\n\nJoin us for Sunday Reset\, a beg
 inner-friendly two-hour experience designed to help you step away from the
  busyness of everyday life and enjoy a peaceful afternoon of guided medita
 tion and an Energy Blessing experience.\nNo meditation experience is neede
 d. This event is centered on experience rather than lectures\, so you can 
 simply come as you are\, relax\, and participate at your own pace.\nWhat t
 o Expect\n🧘 Guided Meditation\nSettle into a calm and comfortable space
  with a guided meditation experience. The meditation will be guided throug
 h a recorded audio teaching.\n✨ Energy Blessing\nExperience a complete E
 nergy Blessing session in a peaceful and supportive environment.\nA Two-Ho
 ur Reset\nTake time away from your usual routine to quiet your mind\, rela
 x your body\, restore your energy\, and leave feeling refreshed.\nThis eve
 nt is especially welcoming to guests who joined us at the September 27 Bod
 hi Mid-Autumn Festival Community Fair and would like to explore meditation
  and the Energy Blessing experience more deeply. It is also completely ope
 n to the public—whether or not you attended the Community Fair.\nSunday\
