 l emphasis on hands-on mitzvahs. Kids won’t just learn about Jewish valu
 es—they’ll put them into action!\nAt Club Kindness\, we’ll brighten 
 someone’s day\, care for those in need\, explore Ahavat Yisrael\, show k
 indness to animals and care for the world around us—discovering along th
 e way just how much good even little hands can do.\n\nAnd we’ll still ba
 ke\, build\, create\, taste and celebrate our way through the Jewish year\
 , experiencing holidays and traditions in ways kids can see\, touch and do
 .\nJudaism comes to life\, one mitzvah at a time!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: http
