DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMirthquake: Monday Live Comedy
  in the Richmond w/ $5 Drinks (SF)\nJesse Hett\nLooking for a great way to
  kick off your week? Look no further than Mirthquake: Monday Live Comedy i
 n the Richmond! This live stand-up comedy show\, held every Monday at the 
