DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Recreation & ParksSan Francisco Recreation and P
 ark and community members will hold a groundbreaking ceremony for a new ou
 tdoor recreation area at the Golden Gate Park Senior Center. The project w
 ill add fitness equipment\, seating\, and flexible lawn space for activiti
 es including dance\, tai chi\, yoga\, and Zumba. The Senior Center parking
  lot will be closed for the event.\nOriginal Event Description:\nJoin Rec 
 and Park and community members for a groundbreaking ceremony for a new out
 door recreation area at the Golden Gate Park Senior Center (6101 Fulton St
 reet) on Tuesday\, October 6 from 2 to 3 p.m. The project will add fitness
  equipment\, seating and flexible space on the small lawn behind the cente
 r for activities such as dance\, tai chi\, yoga and Zumba. Note that the S
 enior Center parking lot will be closed that day for the event. Learn more
  about the project at the link in the bio! #sanfrancisco #goldengatepark #
 goldengateparkseniorcenter\n@sfrecpark\nSan Francisco Recreation & Parks\n
 The San Francisco Recreation and Park Department manages more than 230 par
 ks\, including Golden Gate Park\, Coit Tower and Dolores Park.\nlinktr.ee/
 SFRecpark\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/p/DeH9M__SJmG/?utm
