SUMMARY:“Moth Belly Autumn” Fall 2026 Art Market w/ 18 Artists: 100% B
 enefits CALMA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1638846@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art Museums
DESCRIPTION:Moth Belly GalleryMoth Belly Gallery hosts an autumn art marke
 t featuring work from nearly 20 contributing artists. One hundred percent 
 of proceeds will benefit CALMA\, a volunteer-run Bay Area organization tha
 t provides aid to laborers\, migrants\, and asylum seekers. The organizers
  are also seeking donations of art\, prints\, merchandise\, and crafts\, a
 long with one or two additional vendors willing to donate all sales to CAL
 MA.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_We’re excited to announce our upcomin
 g autumn art market that will be taking place on Wednesday\, October 7th\,
  from 6-9pm\, and of which 100% of proceeds from will go to @calmaofficial
 _org—a volunteer-run Bay Area organization providing crucial aid to labo
 rers\, migrants\, and asylum seekers.\nMoth Belly Gallery 912 Larkin St\, 
 San Francisco\, CA 94109\nSo far we’ve got almost twenty artists who are
  contributing work: @kthx.huang\, @ellarose.avery\, @mikemonteiro\, @shrey
 purohit\, @harrynordlinger\, @jesredwood\, @selinalee.art\, @art.tits\, @f
 abiobene\, @foxylobotomy\, @dead.leaf.halloween\, @steponhen\, @wrensayler
 \, @manasathimmiya\, @importantuncle\, @nocanhandle\, @adam.seth.gluskin a
 nd @gothlisafrank\nWe’re still accepting donations of original art\, pri
 nts\, merch\, or crafts if anyone would like to contribute. And there’s 
