DESCRIPTION:Director Joko Anwar plunges viewers into a high-security priso
 n ruled by feuding gangs and a tyrannical warden. The arrival of a new inm
 ate kicks off a series of mysterious gruesome murders that leave its victi
 ms on morbid display. The hapless inmates trapped in the prison must overc
 ome their rivalries to unmask an invisible\, otherworldly enemy. No one is
  safe as the cells cage in the horrors and a ghost roams the prison with m
