DESCRIPTION:San Francisco Fleet Week 2026: Air Show + Schedule of Events\n
 Navy Flight Demonstration Squadron\nLook up in the sky when you hear the r
 oaring of jet engines and head down to SF’s northern waterfront for San 
 Francisco’s annual Fleet Week air show and festival.\nSan Francisco Flee
 t Week returns October 4-12\, 2026\, bringing more than a full week of mil
 itary bands\, ship tours\, the Parade of Ships\, community events\, and th
 e big aerial spectacle over San Francisco Bay. The centerpiece is the Flee
 t Week Air Show\, October 9-11\, 2026\, with the U.S. Navy Blue Angels hea
 dlining the show between the Golden Gate Bridge and Alcatraz.\nThe air sho
 w is presented by United and features the Blue Angels\, United Airlines 77
 7\, U.S. Air Force F-22 Raptor Demo Team\, U.S. Air Force Heritage Flight\
 , U.S. Marine Corps F-35B Demo Team\, U.S. Coast Guard aircraft\, U.S. Nav
 y E-6B Mercury\, U.S. Air Force C-130 Hercules\, U-2 Dragon Lady and C-5 S
 uper Galaxy flybys\, and T-6 Texan IIs. The United 777 is billed as the on
 ly commercial airliner performing a fully choreographed act at a U.S. air 
 show.\nSan Francisco Fleet Week 2026\nFull Festival: October 4-12\, 2026\n
 Air Show: October 9-11\, 2026\, 12-4 PM\n2026 Fleet Week Event Map\nSan Fr
 ancisco Waterfront\nFREE\nSee full air show schedule\n2026 Fleet Week Sche
 dule\nAir Show\nFriday\, Saturday & Sunday\, October 9-11\, 2026 | 12-4 PM
  | San Francisco Waterfront\n– Thursday afternoon: Each year there are t
 ypically Blue Angels “test flights” on Thursday.\nAlthough it’s not 
 the full a...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: http://fleetweeksf.org/air-show/\nDetail
 s: https://sf.funcheap.com/fleet-week-blue-angels-practice-day/\nSource: F
 uncheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Home-P
 age-Ticker-3.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Marina Green\, Marina Blvd & Fillmore St.\, San Francisco CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/fleet-week-blue-angels-practice-day/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:El Grupo de Apoyo Latino
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T170000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-16869107@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ
DESCRIPTION:El Grupo de Apoyo Latino de SFAF es un grupo social y educativ
 o que ofrece un espacio abierto\, seguro\, y confidencial para apoyar a la
  comunidad Latina afectada por el VIH y SIDA. Es un grupo diverso\, donde 
 el respeto es la base para que todos los asistentes puedan expresar librem
 ente sus experiencias\, identidad\, étnicidad\, nacionalidad\, sexualidad
 \, y creencias religiosas.\n\nTodas las reuniones son en español y se lle
 van a cabo en un ambiente positivo\, familiar\, y confidencial. Ven a comp
 artir con nosotros\, estamos seguros que encontrarás apoyo y recibirás i
 nformación para mejorar tu calidad de vida.\n\nSFAF ofrece servicios a cu
 alquier persona sin importar su situación migratoria.\n\nPara mas informa
 ción sobre El Grupo\, llama al 415-632-9722.\n\n_____\n\nOur support grou
 p\, El Grupo\, has been a stable source of family and community for Latino
 s\, Latinas and their families since the early 1980s. Join us for informat
 ion about sexual health and harm reduction\, meals and social support\, an
 d help finding health and social services.\n\nMeetings are in-person at 94
 0 Howard St Group Room A every Thursday from 3 to 5 pm.\n\nTickets: https:
 //www.sfaf.org/event/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino/2026-10-08/\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino-tickets\nSource: 
 DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/29788684/b38fa693-f2aa-45c2-9642-f344f0ad30d6.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:San Francisco AIDS Foundation\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/8/el-grupo-de-apoyo-latino-tickets
END:VEVENT
