DESCRIPTION:Tre Allen (SF Fleet Week)Celebrate Fleet Week at the Heroes Bl
 ock Party!\nSan Francisco residents and visitors are invited to an unforge
 ttable evening in North Beach at the Heroes Block Party\, hosted by Americ
 an Legion Cathay Post 384!\nExperience a patriotic street celebration feat
 uring San Francisco’s biggest American flag\, DJs\, musical artists\, th
 e Great Wall Youth Orchestra\, and an electrifying performance by the U.S.
  Navy Band Southwest’s\, Destroyers Rock Band.\n\nChallenge first respon
 ders\, friends\, and family in the Cornhole Tournament\, then head inside 
 the Post to enjoy beer\, wine\, and cocktails. The block party will featur
 e live entertainment\, community spirit\, and Fleet Week excitement.\nThis
  is one celebration you won’t want to miss!\nThursday\, October 8 | 5–
 9 p.m.\nPowell Street between Vallejo and Green Streets\nNorth Beach\, San
  Francisco\nBring your friends\, celebrate our heroes\, and experience Fle
 et Week in the heart of San Francisco!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://fleetwe
 eksf.org/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-fleet-week-2026-heroes-bl
 ock-party-sfs-biggest-american-flag-north-beach/\nSource: Funcheap SF
