DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerChabot Staff$25 Adult\, $35 Ki
 ds (Age 3-8)\, Members get $15 off per ticket\nYour Ticket Includes Center
  Admission – a $19-24 Value Per Ticket!\nBuy Tickets\n\nExplore\, learn\
 , and connect with nature during Family Nature Adventures! Join us every 2
 nd Saturday March – November for an unforgettable journey into the stunn
 ing parks surrounding Chabot Space & Science Center. Each month features a
 n exciting new theme\, from the tiny world of insects to the grandeur of t
 owering redwood trees.\n\nThis Months Theme: Spidey Spectacular – Advent
 ures with Arachnids!\nSpin your way into the fascinating world of spiders 
 and arachnids! This month’s adventure is packed with discovery and excit
 ement:\nInteractive Workshop: Learn all about native spiders\, their incre
 dible adaptations\, and even how they behave in space.\nSpider Safari: Gra
 b a magnifying glass and set off into the redwood forest to find hidden sp
 iders\, marvel at their intricate webs\, and explore their natural habitat
 .\n\n$25.00\n\nTickets: https://chabotspace.org/calendar/family-nature-adv
 entures-spiders/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/family-nature-adventure
 s-spiders/\nSource: Funcheap SF
