 ks at the Fall 2026 ArtSpan Open Studios.\nWhether you’re an art lover o
 r just looking for a cool way to spend the day\, this event is perfect for
  you. Don’t miss the artistic buzz this Fall.\n\nThe Details:\nOctober 1
 0-11\, 2026 (Saturday & Sunday)\n10:30 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. both days\nSports
