DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T190000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17884762@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:This heartbreakingly beautiful indictment of 1950s American mo
 res by Douglas Sirk follows the blossoming love between a well-off widow (
 Jane Wyman) and her handsome and earthy younger gardener (Rock Hudson). Wh
 en their romance prompts the scorn of her children and country club friend
 s\, she must decide whether to pursue her own happiness or carry on a lone
 ly\, hemmed-in existence for the sake of the approval of others. With the 
 help of ace cinematographer Russell Metty\, Sirk imbues nearly every shot 
 with a vivid and distinct emotional tenor. A profoundly felt film about cl
 ass and conformity in small-town America\, All That Heaven Allows is a pin
 nacle of expressionistic Hollywood melodrama.\n\nThis film can be used wit
 h loyalty cards or our 2026 annual CinemaSFBay passes\n\nTickets: https://
 ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/19902?siteToken=52wkfzmjpwjjfpz3ye7tz8
 wscg\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/all-that-heaven-allo
 ws-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7760419;-122.498063
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34623057/7096f503-72c2-40c2-ba4f-7a9ad1b940ee.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Balboa Theater\, 3630 Balboa St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/11/all-that-heaven-allows-tickets
END:VEVENT
