DESCRIPTION:Join us every Saturday for Salsa Lessons and Social Dancing\nw
 ith San Francisco-based\, award-winning instructors Ava Apple and Rodolfo\
 nGuzman.\n\nAdvanced online registration for the class is $14 plus\nproces
 sing fee. Walk-ins are $20. Students can stay for the live band\nperforman
 ce at 9:30 PM.\n\nAgenda:\n7:00-7:30 PM - Check-in\, mingle\, practice\, a
 nd ask questions.\n7:30-8:30 PM - Salsa class with Ava & Rodolfo. Mixed\nl
 evels\, no partner needed\, and beginners welcome.\n8:30-9:00 PM - Practic
