CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Want to have more fun and success with dating? Explore your da
 ting tendencies\, expand your dating pool\, and live in the moment in this
  improv-based dating course with dating coach Dylan.\nWhat: Workshop desig
 ned to provide a fun and informative experience where participants practic
