DESCRIPTION:Asians Are StrongOne of San Francisco’s tastiest community f
 ood festivals is back for its third year\, bringing a whole world of dumpl
 ings to the Ferry Building. World of Dumplings returns Sunday\, October 25
 \, with 25+ restaurant vendors serving up dumplings from around the globe\
 , and admission is free.\n\nExpect plenty of familiar favorites alongside 
 dumplings you may not have tried before\, from Chinese wontons and Japanes
 e gyoza to Nepalese momos\, Turkish mantı\, Italian ravioli and Spanish e
 mpanadas. Come hungry\, because there will also be eating contests\, cooki
 ng demonstrations\, dumpling trivia and a beer garden.\n\nThe family-frien
 dly festival will also feature live music\, performances\, family activiti
 es and raffle prizes throughout the day. It’s a pretty compelling excuse
  to spend a Sunday eating your way around the world\, one dumpling at a ti
 me.\n\nWorld of Dumplings\nDate: Sunday\, October 25\, 2026\nTime: 11 am 
 – 5 pm\nVenue: Ferry Building\, San Francisco\nCost: FREE\n\nView this p
 ost on Instagram\n\nA post shared by Asians Are Strong (@asiansarestrong)\
