DESCRIPTION:San Francisco CAKE PICNICSpend Halloween morning with CAKE PIC
 NIC at Levi’s Plaza for a sweet and spooky celebration near the Bay! Thi
 s is our first-ever Halloween CAKE PICNIC and it’s so special. You won
 ’t want to miss it!\nWe’re gathering outside among the trees and autum
 n air to share hundreds of cakes inspired by the coziest flavors of the se
 ason. Think brown butter pumpkin spice\, chocolate Biscoff\, cinnamon roll
  cake\, caramel apple\, toasted marshmallow\, kinako chiffon cake\, and so
  much more. Everyone is so creative so I’m sure we’ll be floored by th
 e flavor pairings and decorations. Vanilla Bean Project will also be joini
 ng and sharing some surprises and goodies with all of us!\nBring a whole c
 ake you’re proud to share and\, if you’d like\, come dressed in your s
 weetest\, spookiest\, or most wonderfully strange costume. Whether your ca
 ke is playfully haunted\, beautifully autumnal\, or simply filled with you
 r favorite fall flavors\, we can’t wait to see what you bring to the tab
 le. Let’s spend Halloween morning tasting hundreds of cakes\, meeting ne
 w friends\, and making a little autumn magic together in San Francisco!\n\
 nNote: Cakes from Costco\, Walmart\, or Safeway will not be allowed at the
  event. Please support our wonderful local bakeries like Tartine\, Loquat\
 , Butter&\, Bake Sum\, and more. They make such delicious cakes and would 
 love to be a part of your CAKE PICNIC day. Plan accordingly!\nOriginal Eve
 nt Description:\n_San Francisco CAKE PICNIC 2026 – Fall Tour 2026\nSat O
