DESCRIPTION:Bhangra And BeatsCelebrate Diwali at the free Bhangra & Beats 
 Night Market in downtown San Francisco’s Yerba Buena Gardens. The event 
 features live Bhangra performances\, interactive dance lessons\, DJs\, nig
 ht market shopping\, food vendors\, and family activities\, all in honor o
 f the Festival of Lights. Open to all ages and family-friendly.\nOriginal 
 Event Description:\n_A free night market series in downtown SF featuring m
 usic\, dance\, food\, drinks\, shopping\, and more!Bhangra & Beats Night M
 arketOfficial City of San Francisco Diwali CelebrationFriday\, November 13
 th | 4:00–9:00 PMYerba Buena Gardens | Mission Street (between 3rd & 4th
 )San FranciscoFree | Family-Friendly | All AgesBhangra & Beats returns to 
 Yerba Buena Gardens for a special Diwali edition. Join us for an unforgett
 able evening as Yerba Buena Gardens\, Jessie Square\, and Yerba Buena Lane
  glow with the vibrant sights\, sounds\, flavors\, and spirit of South Asi
 an culture as we celebrate Diwali\, the Festival of Lights.At the heart of
  it all is the joyful Bhangra & Beats experience—a family-friendly celeb
 ration where traditional Punjabi rhythms meet Bay Area energy. Non Stop Bh
 angra will once again lead the festivities with its signature mix of inter
 active dance lessons\, vibrant performances\, live dhol drumming\, DJs\, a
 nd an open dance floor\, alongside a lively night market featuring local f
 ood vendors\, artisans\, community activations\, family-friendly activitie
 s\, and special offerings from neighborhood restaurants and bars.Di...\n\n
 Free\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/bhangra-beats-night-market-o
 fficial-city-of-sf-diwali-celebration-tickets-1996185713204\nDetails: http
