DESCRIPTION:$1 Drink Fridays: “Battle of the Decades” DJ Party (North 
 Beach)\nBattle Of the Decades\nFridays are now a little bit more awesome. 
 Did someone say $1 drinks?\nMonroe in North Beach hosts “Battle of the D
